# Keep development files and repository metadata out of the public Worker.
# See wrangler.toml for why this replaced the `rm -rf .git` build hook.
.git/
.dev/
.claude/
.github/
.agents/
.codex/
.vscode/
.wrangler/
node_modules/
graphify-out*/
test-results/
scripts/
doc/

# Screenshots kept at the repo root for the docs. This is deliberately NOT a
# blanket "*.png": assets/img/decks/**/*.png are the deck illustrations the
# app loads at runtime, and the global rule left 36 of them answering 404 in
# production while the .json decks referenced them. The other screenshots live
# under .dev/ and test-results/, already excluded above.
shot-*.png

*.md